    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14778" root="رثو" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْثُوٌّ</span></b> , meaning A man <i>weak in intellect,</i> is from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّثْيَةُ</span>, [mentioned in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رثى</span>,] and [therefore]

by rule should be <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْثِىٌّ</span>. (M.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْثُوْءٌ</span> [signifies the same, (see this word, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رثأ</span>,) and in
like manner, accord. to ISd,]
is from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّثْيَةُ</span>, irreg.,
being with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span> (M in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رثى</span>.)

